    "title": "Trump Administration Cuts Mental Health Funding",
    "text": "3\nHere’s a summary of the provided text:\nThe Trump governance has reversed its decision to cut funding for programs supporting addiction and mental health. The initial decision, reported by NPR, faced swift and bipartisan criticism from lawmakers and public health organizations who warned of the devastating impact on vital services. The reversal was announced late Tuesday night.\nThe article also includes a link to the original NPR report detailing the initial termination of the grants and features an image related to the story.",
